847 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 481 0 R
/E ( The main post asset stays visually central, with any included carousel assets, video clips, or supporting media directly beside/below it. A simple progress bar shows completed, current, and upcoming stages. Each stage acts as an entry point into its own focused layer. When the creator saves or finishes work inside a layer, they return to this dashboard with the current version automatically updated.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
848 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 481 0 R
/E (Surface-level utilities such as Copy Text, Original Link, Share Preview, start/target dates, and autosave status remain accessible without displaying the underlying transcript, version history, editing controls, or other detailed information. Those remain one layer deeper.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
849 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 481 0 R
/E (The same dashboard structure adapts to single-image, carousel/multi-asset, and video posts rather than requiring separate workflows.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
